    "description": "动态制作：-夜莺Night（bilibili 抖音）\r\n原画师：插画师居士（bilibili）\r\n有bug请在评论区反馈\r\n如果喜欢还请多多支持一下哦\r\n\r\n功能简要展示:\r\n    视差设置: 壁纸拥有鼠标景深视差，营造3D氛围\r\n    人物设置: 双击人物可触发棍花动画，人物动效可关闭，支持人物位置改变\r\n    氛围开关，三种氛围： 亮金、暗金、深蓝。大家可按需选择\r\n    背景设置:背景云层、雷电、灰烬、火星、雾气等拥有相应开关\r\n    组件设置: 时间组件、音频可视化、鼠标尾迹，多种字体选择等等\r\n\r\n如果带不动壁纸，占用过高，可以将人物动效由精细更改至简略或关闭动效，适当关闭一些效果，同时进入wallpaper设置纹理分辨率为高性能，降低帧率。\r\n\r\nDynamic production: - Nightingale Night (bilibili Tiktok)\r\nOriginal artist: Illustrator and layman (bilibili)\r\nIf there are bugs, please provide feedback in the comment section\r\nIf you like it, please support me more\r\nFunction brief display:\r\nParallax setting: Wallpaper has mouse depth of field disparity, creating a 3D atmosphere\r\nCharacter settings: Double clicking on a character triggers stick flower animation, character animations can be turned off, and character position changes are supported\r\nAtmosphere switch, three atmospheres: bright gold, dark gold, and deep blue. Everyone can choose according to their needs\r\nBackground settings: Corresponding switches are available for background clouds, lightning, ash, Mars, fog, etc\r\nComponent settings: time component, audio visualization, mouse trail, multiple font options, etc\r\nIf you can't move the wallpaper and it takes up too much space, you can change the character animation from fine to simple or turn off animation, and turn off some effects appropriately. At the same time, enter Wallpaper to set the texture resolution to high performance and reduce the frame rate.",
